Recommends: boswas-compat-manager, dolphin, kinfocenter
Description: Boswas OS Control Center, Security Center and Software Center
 The settings hub of Boswas OS (KDE Plasma). One window with a page per
 area, each explaining the state of the device and opening the matching KDE
 settings modules (kcmshell6) instead of re-implementing them:
 .
  * Personalization: Boswas desktop presets (boswas-preset) and the KDE
    appearance modules
  * Network, Bluetooth, Display, Sound, Power, Storage, Users, Devices,
    Privacy and System pages
  * Boswas Software Center: installed Boswas, Windows and native
    applications, searchable and ready to open
  * Windows Compatibility: runtime health and the Compatibility Manager
  * Boswas Security Center: the local posture checks of boswas-cli and the
    device agent's state, as Secure, Warning, Attention or Error
  * Boswas Update Center: automatic security updates (read-only)
  * About Boswas OS, and in live sessions a way to restart into the
    installer
 .
 Control Center runs as the desktop user and never as root. It starts only
 a fixed list of programs, each with a fixed argument list and a timeout,
 and never through a shell.
